      "created_at": "2018-09-26T19:21:26Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-09-26T19:21:26Z",
      "body": "I feel my privacy is violated when software phones home without asking me whether it's ok for it to do so in particular when it's not clear which data it sends \"home\". In the case of opt-in that would not happen. As it is, and because the setting wasn't described (thank you for documenting it now) I wasn't aware of that happening.\r\n\r\nI now am. and I still think it should be made opt-in.",
